        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/6bbea6/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-10-17T19:58:57.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hi there, I'm not quite sure this is the right place to put this or if this has been proposed before, but the search hasn't turned up anything for me so I'll give it a shot.</p><p>I was wondering if it would be possible to make the Promo Decks - Unity and Ambuscade - available via the BGG store. I know they are available here at GTG but for non-US based people like me, S&amp;H is killer and thats a problem the BGG store solves very nicely.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Anyway, since I'm here I might as well express my gratitude to the devs for making this great game and pumping out expansions. Keep up the good work guys, I'm loving it.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:36:26.032Z",
