        "raw": "<p>Hi there, I&#39;m not quite sure this is the right place to put this or if this has been proposed before, but the search hasn&#39;t turned up anything for me so I&#39;ll give it a shot.</p><p>I was wondering if it would be possible to make the Promo Decks - Unity and Ambuscade - available via the BGG store. I know they are available here at GTG but for non-US based people like me, S&amp;H is killer and thats a problem the BGG store solves very nicely.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Anyway, since I&#39;m here I might as well express my gratitude to the devs for making this great game and pumping out expansions. Keep up the good work guys, I&#39;m loving it.</p>",
